──── cli surface ────
usage: vipsania [-h] {annotate,train,download} ...

Vipsania - an unsupervised deep learning ab-initio gene finder.

positional arguments:
  {annotate,train,download}
    annotate            Generate a genome annotation of a fasta file with a
                        given trained Vipsania model.
    train               Train a Vipsania model. Supply either a path to a json
                        model configuration file or the ID for an existing
                        training run.
    download            Download a pretrained Vipsania model ahead of time.
                        Annotation downloads the model it needs on its own, so
                        this is only useful to prepare a machine that has no
                        internet access when it annotates.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
